Below was my daily report:
"Daily Report
Name: Ishi Jemila Jimenez
ID: PS26Y413
Date: July 29, 2026
Today I am stationed and helped out at where the cables are being cut and winded. I learned the following:
-How to cut the cable and how long to cut it (length needed: 10.25m)
-How to wind the cable and the dimensions needed (50cm has to be left at both ends from the radius of the loop (loop diameter: 20cm))
